[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8160.47, "timestamp": "02:16:00", "text": "何か。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.31, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "うん。そしてヒンディー語では、「ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8164.709, "timestamp": "02:16:04", "text": "「あのクソ、このクソは面白い。」そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8166.47, "timestamp": "02:16:06", "text": "もっと気づいたんだけど、私はそれが好きだった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8168.069, "timestamp": "02:16:08", "text": "それ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.27, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "兄弟。それはとてもイライラした。なぜなら彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8173.589, "timestamp": "02:16:13", "text": "彼らはそれをやっていた、そう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8177.35, "timestamp": "02:16:17", "text": "MCUの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8179.27, "timestamp": "02:16:19", "text": "カメオ出演のキャラクターで、彼らは「ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8181.91, "timestamp": "02:16:21", "text": "このキャラクター、知ってますよね？ そうですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.189, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "邪魔だ、どけ。私はあの番組が大嫌いだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8191.669, "timestamp": "02:16:31", "text": "それも私がそれを嫌ったもう一つの理由だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8195.429, "timestamp": "02:16:35", "text": "ショーは壮観だった スパイダーマンは死んだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8197.19, "timestamp": "02:16:37", "text": "あの番組だよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8199.27, "timestamp": "02:16:39", "text": "まるで彼らが壮大な計画を中止したかのように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8202.709, "timestamp": "02:16:42", "text": "それ。うん。そのヤギは素晴らしかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8205.389, "timestamp": "02:16:45", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.27, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "ヤギの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8214.91, "timestamp": "02:16:54", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8219.99, "timestamp": "02:16:59", "text": "実に壮観だ。"}]